## 6. Where This Metadata Is Used (Important)

### ✅ Allowed

* Stream display
* Recall display
* Recognition (“Oh yeah, this link”)

### ❌ Not allowed

* Ranking
* Insight generation
* Feed creation
* “You saved this because…”

Metadata ≠ intelligence.

---

## 7. Privacy & Trust Guardrails (Critical)

You MUST enforce:

* No JS execution (no Puppeteer initially)
* No cookies
* No auth headers
* No crawling beyond first page
* Respect robots.txt

If metadata fails → **that’s fine**.

---

## 8. Common Mistakes to Avoid

❌ Fetching metadata synchronously
❌ Showing “loading metadata…”
❌ Asking users to fix metadata
❌ Over-summarizing
❌ Treating metadata as ground truth

Your system should feel:

> “Quietly helpful, never eager.”

---

